### Get all product category links

GET http://localhost:5000/api/product_categories
Content-Type: application/json

### Get product category with id

GET http://localhost:5000/api/product_categories/27
Content-Type: application/json

### Create product category link

POST http://localhost:5000/api/product_categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "category_id": 1
}

### Update product category link

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/product_categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "product_id": 1,
  "category_id": 2
}

### Delete product category link

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/product_categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
